OL,3,GNEWSAHomes evacuated due to fire at
OL,4,Avillage church
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of houses were evacuated
OL,7,Fovernight due to a fire at a church in
OL,8,Fthe village of Kilburn.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,11,Fit was called to the two-storey
OL,12,Fbuilding in Chapel Street at 00:24 BST
OL,13,Fon Friday. Six appliances and an aerial
OL,14,Fladder platform were sent to the scene.
OL,16,FPolice closed the road and co-ordinated
OL,17,Fmoving residents to safety as a
OL,18,Fprecaution, the fire service added.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
